This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   The user has been working on unifying favorites and recently-viewed views across portal types (M3U, Xtream, Stalker) in IPTVnator. The multi-phase project includes:
   - Phase 3: Route integration (connecting unified components to routes)
   - Phase 4: Cleanup (removing deprecated components)
   - UI refinements: removing empty sidebar, replacing tabs with segmented controls, fixing width issues, fixing scope toggle bug, adding skeleton loading states
   - Navigation architecture analysis: deciding whether to keep/remove/consolidate the rail sidebar favorites link vs header star icon after the unification refactor

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - Angular `withComponentInputBinding()` for binding route data to component inputs
   - Angular `ActivatedRoute` parent params resolution (child routes can't access parent route params directly)
   - `mat-button-toggle-group` as segmented controls (replacing `mat-tab-group`)
   - Signal-based state management (`signal()`, `computed()`, `input()`, `output()`)
   - `@switch`/`@if`/`@for` control flow (modern Angular syntax)
   - OnPush change detection strategy
   - SCSS `@use` partials for shared styles (must be at top of file)
   - CSS shimmer animation for skeleton loading states
   - Electron CDP debugging via `agent-browser` tool
   - Route `data` properties binding to component inputs
   - Nx monorepo build system

3. Files and Code Sections:

   - **`apps/web/src/app/app.config.ts`**
     - Added `withComponentInputBinding()` to `provideRouter()` to enable route data → component input binding
     ```typescript
     import { provideRouter, withComponentInputBinding } from '@angular/router';
     // ...
     provideRouter(routes, withComponentInputBinding()),
     ```

   - **`libs/portal/stalker/feature/src/lib/stalker-feature.routes.ts`**
     - Replaced `loadStalkerFavoritesComponent` and `loadStalkerRecentlyViewedComponent` with `loadUnifiedCollectionComponent`
     ```typescript
     const loadUnifiedCollectionComponent: ComponentLoader = () =>
         import('@iptvnator/portal/shared/ui').then(
             (c) => c.UnifiedCollectionPageComponent
         );
     // Routes:
     { path: 'favorites', loadComponent: loadUnifiedCollectionComponent, data: { mode: 'favorites', portalType: 'stalker' } },
     { path: 'recent', loadComponent: loadUnifiedCollectionComponent, data: { mode: 'recent', portalType: 'stalker' } },
     ```

   - **`apps/web/src/app/app.routes.ts`** (lines 64-72)
     - Updated global favorites route to use unified component
     ```typescript
     {
         path: 'global-favorites',
         data: { layout: 'workspace', mode: 'favorites', defaultScope: 'all' },
         loadComponent: () =>
             import('@iptvnator/portal/shared/ui').then(
                 (c) => c.UnifiedCollectionPageComponent
             ),
     },
     ```

   - **`libs/workspace/shell/feature/src/lib/workspace-shell/workspace-shell.component.ts`** (line 264)
     - Fixed empty sidebar by removing 'favorites' and 'recent' from `isFavoritesContextRoute()`
     ```typescript
     readonly isFavoritesContextRoute = computed(() => {
         const context = this.currentContext();
         const section = this.currentSection();
         if (!context) return false;
         return (
             (context.provider === 'xtreams' ||
                 context.provider === 'stalker') &&
             section === 'downloads'
         );
     });
     ```

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/components/unified-collection/unified-collection-page.component.ts`**
     - Major refactoring across the session:
       - Replaced `MatTabsModule` with signal-based content type switching
       - Added `selectedContentType` signal and `availableTypes` computed
       - Removed `MatProgressSpinnerModule`, added skeleton arrays
       - Fixed `playlistId` resolution to walk up route tree
     ```typescript
     readonly selectedContentType = signal<CollectionContentType>('live');
     readonly skeletonRows = Array.from({ length: 12 }, (_, i) => i);
     readonly skeletonCards = Array.from({ length: 8 }, (_, i) => i);

     readonly playlistId = computed(() => {
         let current = this.route.snapshot;
         while (current) {
             if (current.params['id']) {
                 return current.params['id'] as string;
             }
             current = current.parent!;
         }
         return undefined;
     });

     readonly availableTypes = computed(() => {
         const types: CollectionContentType[] = [];
         if (this.hasLive()) types.push('live');
         if (this.hasMovies()) types.push('movie');
         if (this.hasSeries()) types.push('series');
         return types;
     });

     readonly showContentToggle = computed(() => this.availableTypes().length > 1);

     onContentTypeChange(value: CollectionContentType): void {
         this.selectedContentType.set(value);
     }

     private autoSelectContentType(): void {
         const types = this.availableTypes();
         if (types.length > 0 && !types.includes(this.selectedContentType())) {
             this.selectedContentType.set(types[0]);
         }
     }
     ```

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/components/unified-collection/unified-collection-page.component.html`**
     - Replaced mat-tab-group with second mat-button-toggle-group in single-row header
     - Replaced `@if`/tab structure with `@switch (selectedContentType())`
     - Replaced `<mat-spinner>` with context-aware skeleton templates (list for live, grid for movie/series)
     ```html
     <div class="collection-header">
         <span class="collection-title">{{ title() | translate }}</span>
         @if (showContentToggle()) {
             <mat-button-toggle-group class="content-toggle"
                 [value]="selectedContentType()"
                 (change)="onContentTypeChange($event.value)"
                 hideSingleSelectionIndicator>
                 @if (hasLive()) { <mat-button-toggle value="live">{{ 'PORTALS.LIVE_TV' | translate }}</mat-button-toggle> }
                 @if (hasMovies()) { <mat-button-toggle value="movie">{{ 'PORTALS.MOVIES' | translate }}</mat-button-toggle> }
                 @if (hasSeries()) { <mat-button-toggle value="series">{{ 'PORTALS.SERIES' | translate }}</mat-button-toggle> }
             </mat-button-toggle-group>
         }
         <mat-button-toggle-group class="scope-toggle" ...>...</mat-button-toggle-group>
     </div>
     ```

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/components/unified-collection/unified-collection-page.component.scss`**
     - Added `@use '../../styles/skeleton'`
     - Changed `.collection-title` to use `margin-right: auto` for flex spacing
     - Replaced `.loading-state` and `.content-tabs` with `.skeleton-list` and `.skeleton-grid`

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/components/unified-collection/unified-live-tab.component.html`**
     - Restructured: when no player active, show full-width channel list (no sidebar layout)
     - When player active, show sidebar+player grid layout
     - Removed "Select a channel to start watching" placeholder in no-player state

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/components/unified-collection/unified-live-tab.component.scss`**
     - Replaced `.itv-container-no-player` grid with `.full-list` flexbox
     - Removed `.no-channel-selected` styles

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/styles/_skeleton.scss`** (NEW)
     - Shared skeleton styles extracted from grid-list + new list skeleton
     - Grid skeleton: `.grid-skeleton-card`, `.grid-skeleton-thumb`, `.grid-skeleton-badge`, `.grid-skeleton-title`, `.grid-skeleton-line`
     - List skeleton: `.list-skeleton-row`, `.list-skeleton-handle`, `.list-skeleton-avatar`, `.list-skeleton-text`, `.list-skeleton-star`
     - Shared shimmer animation: `@keyframes skeleton-shimmer`

   - **`libs/portal/shared/ui/src/lib/components/grid-list/grid-list.component.scss`**
     - Added `@use '../../styles/skeleton'` at top
     - Removed ~115 lines of inline skeleton styles (now in shared partial)

   - **`libs/workspace/shell/feature/src/index.ts`**
     - Removed `GlobalFavoritesPageComponent` export (file deleted)

   - **`libs/portal/xtream/feature/src/index.ts`**
     - Removed `export * from './lib/favorites/favorites.component'`

   - **`libs/portal/stalker/feature/src/index.ts`**
     - Removed exports for `stalker-favorites` and `recently-viewed` components

   - **Deleted files (Phase 4 cleanup):**
     - `libs/portal/xtream/feature/src/lib/favorites/` (3 files)
     - `libs/portal/stalker/feature/src/lib/stalker-favorites/` (2 files)
     - `libs/portal/stalker/feature/src/lib/recently-viewed/` (2 files)
     - `libs/workspace/shell/feature/src/lib/global-favorites/global-favorites-page.*` (3 files)

   - **`libs/portal/shared/util/src/lib/navigation/portal-rail-links.ts`** (read for analysis)
     - Defines rail sidebar links for each portal type
     - Xtream secondary links include: recently-added, search, recent, favorites, downloads
     - Stalker secondary links include: search, recent, favorites, downloads

4. Errors and fixes:
   - **`withComponentInputBinding` not enabled**: Route `data` wasn't binding to component inputs. Fixed by adding `withComponentInputBinding()` to `provideRouter()` in `app.config.ts`.

   - **Empty "Filter by type" sidebar**: The workspace shell showed an empty category sidebar on favorites/recent views. Root cause: `isFavoritesContextRoute()` matched 'favorites', 'recent', and 'downloads'. Fixed by removing 'favorites' and 'recent', keeping only 'downloads'.

   - **`playlistId` always `undefined`**: The `UnifiedCollectionPageComponent` read `this.route.snapshot.params['id']` but `:id` was on the parent route (`xtreams/:id`), not the child route (`favorites`). The child route's `ActivatedRoute` had empty params `{}`. Fixed by walking up the route tree: `while (current) { if (current.params['id']) return...; current = current.parent; }`. This caused the scope toggle to always show "All playlists" data regardless of toggle state.

   - **Barrel export errors after cleanup**: After deleting old component files, barrel `index.ts` files still referenced them. Build failed with "Could not resolve" errors. Fixed by removing the stale export lines from `libs/portal/xtream/feature/src/index.ts`, `libs/portal/stalker/feature/src/index.ts`, and `libs/workspace/shell/feature/src/index.ts`.

   - **`@use` SCSS placement**: Placed `@use '../../styles/skeleton'` in the middle of `grid-list.component.scss` after removing inline styles. SCSS requires `@use` at the top of the file. Got error: "@use rules must be written before any other rules". Fixed by moving `@use` to line 1 and removing the duplicate.

5. Problem Solving:
   - Solved the full-width layout issue by restructuring the live tab template: when no player is active, the channel list renders in a `full-list` container instead of a sidebar grid layout
   - Solved scope toggle not working by debugging with `agent-browser` eval — confirmed `route.snapshot.params` was `{}` and `route.parent.snapshot.params` had the `id`
   - Solved skeleton loading implementation by extracting shared SCSS partial and using context-aware skeleton templates (list vs grid based on `selectedContentType`)

6. All user messages:
